"""Goblin AI – the window (Meta+A, AppGrid, "goblin ai app" or /app in "goblin ai" in the terminal).

Chat with free (and optionally paid) AI services (see /usr/share/goblincakes/ai/goblinai.py): questions,
texts, recipes, help with the computer. Attach a text file to have it corrected
and saved back. Suggested commands are cards with a Run button; their output goes
back to the AI. Conversations are kept in ~/.local/share/goblincakes/ai/.
Only one window: starting it again brings the open one to the front.
"""
